    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d100-a1-a8">

                <pb facs="0300" n="242" sameAs="frus:frus1866p3/pg242"/>


                <head>Obituary.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Guadalajara,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1866-06-29"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >June</hi> 29, 1866.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>J. Guadalupe Montenegro and wife inform you, with profound grief, that their son
                    Diego, aged sixteen years and five months, was murdered and robbed, on the 21st
                    of this month, by order of the chief authority of Zapotlan, for no other crime
                    than being named Montenegro.</p>
                <p>They beg you to pray God for the eternal repose of his soul, and the protection
                    of the lives and property of us unfortunate Mexicans.</p>
                <p>(Printed by Brambila.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
